Usage:
  web [OPTIONS] seed [seed-OPTIONS]

Seed users, posts and comments; refuses to run where FLY_APP_NAME is set.

Help Options:
  -h, --help              Show this help message

[seed command options]
          --site-root=    Public root URL of the site, used in seeded links
                          [$SITE_ROOT]
          --reset         Truncate every table except migrations and
                          system_settings first

    Database:
          --database-url= Postgres connection URL [$DATABASE_URL]
